      "updated": 1792480518260,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Goal: CV + Contact PPG + NLP fuse into ONE glucose\nforecast model (root CLAUDE.md).\n\nReality: no public dataset has photo + text + glucose\ntogether (ADR 0004). Pivoted to separate per-track\nvalidations feeding a plumbing layer that currently\nserves a labeled baseline \u2014 not a fusion result.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Goal: CV + Contact PPG + NLP fuse into ONE glucose\nforecast model (root CLAUDE.md).\n\nReality: no public dataset has photo + text + glucose\ntogether (ADR 0004). Pivoted to separate per-track\nvalidations feeding a plumbing layer that currently\nserves a labeled baseline \u2014 not a fusion result.",
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "baseline": 77
    },
