      "text": "- Identifies dish, not macros\n- Macros = lookup table by dish,\n  not a model output\n- Indonesian dish classifier built\n- On CGMacros (US food): known\n  out-of-domain failure\n- Not yet on shared contract\n  (4 fields have no producer)",
