      "text": "- Pivoted from translation to\n  dish-identity \u2192 carb density\n- Ridge model trained on real\n  ShanghaiT2DM, now LIVE\n- Opt-in mode, T+60 ONLY\n  (T+120 falls back to baseline)\n- Gain is small: MAE 31.1 vs\n  32.3 constant baseline\n- Bahasa input: NON-FUNCTIONAL\n  (no frying/portion lexicon)",
