      "text": "- contract.py: v1.2 validator, single source of truth for all three tracks\n- adapters/: track-native output (CV/NLP/PPG) \u2192 contract records\n- features.py: 3 tiers \u2014 deployable / deployable+askable / oracle\n- glucose_source.py: g0 provenance (fingerstick/CGM/PPG/fallback) w/ trust weights \u2014 LIVE\n- predictor.py: serves BaselineB2Predictor only (plus the gated NLP T+60 opt-in)\n- report.py: refuses to build a results table missing B0/B1/B2\n- api.py: POST /predict, GET /contract, GET /health \u2014 FastAPI, live",
