      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1335964744,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 243973729,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792480518260,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Fix CGMacros data-quality violations (136 rows outside documented ranges) and the\n   positional participant-join bug \u2014 no clinical/gut number means anything until then\n2. Train a deployable-tier model (CV+NLP+PPG features) and report it WITH error bars\n3. Carry \u0394t and add an overlapping-meal guard \u2014 likely cause of flat T+120 result\n4. Route CV fully through the shared contract (4 fields currently have no producer)\n5. Build a Bahasa Indonesia lexicon for NLP \u2014 note input is decorative without it\n6. Settle contract v2.0: PPG ring-fence amendment, g0_source, staleness rule\n7. Reconcile root CLAUDE.md (tri-modal / Indonesian) vs DATA_STRATEGY.md (bi-modal /\n   public-data pivot) \u2014 still open, unresolved",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Fix CGMacros data-quality violations (136 rows outside documented ranges) and the\n   positional participant-join bug \u2014 no clinical/gut number means anything until then\n2. Train a deployable-tier model (CV+NLP+PPG features) and report it WITH error bars\n3. Carry \u0394t and add an overlapping-meal guard \u2014 likely cause of flat T+120 result\n4. Route CV fully through the shared contract (4 fields currently have no producer)\n5. Build a Bahasa Indonesia lexicon for NLP \u2014 note input is decorative without it\n6. Settle contract v2.0: PPG ring-fence amendment, g0_source, staleness rule\n7. Reconcile root CLAUDE.md (tri-modal / Indonesian) vs DATA_STRATEGY.md (bi-modal /\n   public-data pivot) \u2014 still open, unresolved",
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "baseline": 99
    },
